WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:02.210
- Tell me you weren't drinking in there.

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:03.127
- Okay, I don't know what
was going on in there,

00:00:03.127 --> 00:00:04.880
but it was definitely not drinking.

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:07.710
- Okay, that's hardly reassuring.

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:09.500
Can you just get it together?

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:10.333
- Yeah.

00:00:10.333 --> 00:00:11.710
I just, have you seen that bald guy?

00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:13.080
Who is he, he keeps staring at me.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:14.480
He's really creeping me out.

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:17.000
- That's just the new Air Marshall.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.803
It's his job to stare at things.

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:21.590
Okay, you are so out of it.

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:24.560
What the hell did you do
with that guy last night?

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:27.110
- I didn't do, I stayed
in the hotel, okay?

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:29.707
If you don't believe me, call and ask him.

00:00:29.707 --> 00:00:31.000
(audience applauds)
- Hey what's up y'all.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.530
I'm back with Kaley Cuoco

00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:35.047
and that was a sneak peak
of her new HBOMax series,

00:00:35.047 --> 00:00:36.253
"The Flight Attendant".

00:00:36.253 --> 00:00:38.153
Give it up, woo woo!

00:00:38.153 --> 00:00:40.080
(audience applauds)

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:42.720
The new show looks fascinating, and scary.

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:43.553
- It's not that funny.

00:00:43.553 --> 00:00:45.320
- Yeah, I was gonna say is
this more of a serious thing?

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:48.910
It's on HBO and you wake
up next to a dead person?

00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:49.810
- Yes.

00:00:49.810 --> 00:00:51.330
- [Kelly] What?
- Yes.

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:54.750
So we, it's based on a book
that I optioned three years ago.

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:56.221
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:00:56.221 --> 00:00:59.800
- Yeah, it's about a really
fun-loving, heavy drinking

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:01.880
flight attendant who
travels internationally.

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:03.020
- [Kelly] Apparently yes.

00:01:03.020 --> 00:01:04.660
- She goes home with a passenger,

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:06.080
very nice looking passenger

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:08.770
and they have an unforgettable night.

00:01:08.770 --> 00:01:11.190
They get black out, and
go back to his hotel.

00:01:11.190 --> 00:01:12.100
She doesn't know how she got there

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:14.870
and she wakes up in the
morning, hangover from hell.

00:01:14.870 --> 00:01:18.650
And looks over and he's been
brutally murdered next to her

00:01:18.650 --> 00:01:20.180
and she has blood on her hands.

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:22.460
And she is in Thailand, by the way.

00:01:22.460 --> 00:01:23.730
Left that part out.

00:01:23.730 --> 00:01:25.700
They're on an overnight
in Thailand in Bangkok

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:27.120
and she has to get back on her flight

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:28.040
to get back to New York

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:31.430
and she has no idea how this happened.

00:01:31.430 --> 00:01:33.273
- Oh my gosh, so that's like more serious.

00:01:33.273 --> 00:01:34.910
- It's serious there's some quirkiness,

00:01:34.910 --> 00:01:36.050
because I can't not be.

00:01:36.050 --> 00:01:38.130
So it was very much written in my voice.

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:38.963
- Kind of dark comedy?

00:01:38.963 --> 00:01:40.760
- Yes, exactly.

00:01:40.760 --> 00:01:42.450
But yeah, it was pretty serious,

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:44.220
especially as the later episodes go.

00:01:44.220 --> 00:01:48.120
It was a full bare, on the ground, tears,

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:49.740
and it was a whole ordeal.

00:01:49.740 --> 00:01:51.010
- Are you an avid reader?

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:52.890
I know a lot of actors like to do that.

00:01:52.890 --> 00:01:54.560
They like books that they like

00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:55.710
and then they like to turn them into,

00:01:55.710 --> 00:01:56.930
I know Reese does that a lot.

00:01:56.930 --> 00:01:57.910
- Reese does that a lot.

00:01:57.910 --> 00:02:00.060
So funny, when I found "Flight Attendant",

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:03.947
I called my team, the first
words out of my mouth were,

00:02:03.947 --> 00:02:05.602
"Did Reese get the rights to this book?"

00:02:05.602 --> 00:02:07.200
- [Kelly] (laughs)
- Swear to God.

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:08.410
They were like, actually no.

00:02:08.410 --> 00:02:10.440
I was like, ahh get in there.

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:12.077
No, I'm not well read, at all, no.

00:02:12.077 --> 00:02:13.350
- Oh, I love books.

00:02:13.350 --> 00:02:14.183
I love the escape.

00:02:14.183 --> 00:02:15.677
I don't like books that scare me.

00:02:15.677 --> 00:02:18.290
- No, this was, my team
had been telling me,

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:20.050
they kept saying if you
find an article or a book,

00:02:20.050 --> 00:02:20.883
we can adapt it.

00:02:20.883 --> 00:02:22.970
And it was never of interest to me.

00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:24.440
And then when I saw this book

00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:28.190
and I literally read one
sentence and I got this chill

00:02:28.190 --> 00:02:30.390
and I said, oh my God, this is a show

00:02:30.390 --> 00:02:33.670
and I optioned it and
that was three years ago.

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:35.910
- Isn't it crazy how long it takes?

00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:38.350
- Anyone who gets anything done and on TV,

00:02:38.350 --> 00:02:39.760
I bow down to you.

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:40.900
It is a miracle.

00:02:40.900 --> 00:02:42.530
- It started five years ago, by the way.

00:02:42.530 --> 00:02:45.660
If it came out today, it
started five decades ago.

00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:48.110
- People think it happened
overnight and they're like wow.

00:02:48.110 --> 00:02:50.330
And I'm like, no no
this takes a long time.

00:02:50.330 --> 00:02:53.680
So I take my hand off the
anyone that gets anything made

00:02:53.680 --> 00:02:54.513
'cause it's not easy.

00:02:54.513 --> 00:02:56.500
- Yeah, no it's such a process.

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:59.411
Well, hey this is
actually my favorite thing

00:02:59.411 --> 00:03:02.170
and the video is the last
thing we're gonna get to.

00:03:02.170 --> 00:03:05.430
So you're husband likes to
post videos of you sleeping?

00:03:05.430 --> 00:03:06.263
- Yes.

00:03:06.263 --> 00:03:07.096
- [Kelly] And pictures?

00:03:07.096 --> 00:03:08.160
- It's creepy and weird, but yes.

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:10.940
- [Kelly] Which is
amazing and here are a few

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:13.035
of his finest Kaley sleeping moments.

00:03:13.035 --> 00:03:13.868
(audience laughs)

00:03:13.868 --> 00:03:15.240
- So, but wait.

00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:16.440
Okay, you showed the videos.

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:18.720
I need the snoring video right now.

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:19.890
'cause this is my favorite.

00:03:19.890 --> 00:03:21.113
It makes me so happy.

00:03:23.688 --> 00:03:26.271
(loud snoring)

00:03:29.130 --> 00:03:30.182
(loud snoring)

00:03:30.182 --> 00:03:32.610
(laughter)

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:36.850
- My husband's Instagram is
devoted to horses, gardening,

00:03:36.850 --> 00:03:38.330
and trolling me.

00:03:38.330 --> 00:03:39.500
Those are his three favorite things.

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:42.389
- It's like he's a male version
of Chrissy with John Legend.

00:03:42.389 --> 00:03:44.910
All she does is troll him.

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:46.229
I feel like that's what he does with you.

00:03:46.229 --> 00:03:47.062
- He does.

00:03:47.062 --> 00:03:48.953
- And that's my favorite video.

00:03:48.953 --> 00:03:51.104
The fact that you're full
on, looking so rock and roll,

00:03:51.104 --> 00:03:52.660
but then you go (snort).

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:54.870
- Yeah, I'm out and I can
sleep straight up like that.

00:03:54.870 --> 00:03:57.310
He will find me in the
most ridiculous positions

00:03:57.310 --> 00:03:58.620
and that's his favorite thing

00:03:58.620 --> 00:04:01.053
to get me in the most unflattering.

00:04:01.890 --> 00:04:04.805
I think that one he
captioned "Where's her neck?"

00:04:04.805 --> 00:04:07.478
- And like look at how
happy your expression is.

00:04:07.478 --> 00:04:08.524
- I'm so happy.

00:04:08.524 --> 00:04:09.430
- [Kelly] You're having the best dream.

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:10.960
- [Kaley] Wanna be
asleep in that nightshirt

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:11.950
in that cozy bed.

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:14.400
- It's amazing, and you're
totally fine with this.

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:15.233
- Oh, of course I am.

00:04:15.233 --> 00:04:16.900
- Which is why I actually love you more.

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:17.733
- [Kaley] Happy as can be right there.

00:04:17.733 --> 00:04:19.310
- Because this is amazing.

00:04:19.310 --> 00:04:20.143
- Where's her neck?

00:04:20.143 --> 00:04:22.330
- [Kelly] And that just means
that you're a fun person.

00:04:22.330 --> 00:04:23.460
- [Kaley] You're a fun person.

00:04:23.460 --> 00:04:26.380
- [Kelly] Well everybody, "The
Flight Attendant" premieres

00:04:26.380 --> 00:04:28.880
with three episodes on
HBOMax this Thanksgiving.

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:30.437
Y'all gotta check it out.

